- Breaking change: "Delete report by ID" moved to `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/:id` and "Delete report by name" moved to `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/name/:name`. `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/id/:id` still works but is deprecated. `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/:name` no longer deletes by name, so an older `fleetctl delete` or script deleting a report whose name is only digits (for example `42`) now deletes the report with that ID. Upgrade `fleetctl` and scripts before upgrading Fleet. API-only users' existing delete-report permissions are carried over to the new URLs.
